
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #080d1c;
    color: #f8fafc;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  }

  .site-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 24px 8%;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b;
  }

  .brand {
    font-size: 25px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }

  .brand span { color: #38bdf8; }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    color: #cbd5e1;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .hero {
    min-height: 570px;
    padding: 110px 20px 90px;
    text-align: center;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 20%,
      rgba(37,99,235,.25), transparent 60%);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 9px 16px;
    border: 1px solid #334155;
    border-radius: 30px;
    color: #7dd3fc;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 30px auto 20px;
    font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 76px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -3px;
  }

  .gradient-text {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg,#38bdf8,#818cf8);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .hero p {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 15px;
    margin-top: 35px;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 15px 25px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: #2563eb;
    color: white;
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    border: 1px solid #475569;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 65px 8%;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section h2 {
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .section p {
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .tech-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 15px;
    margin-top: 35px;
  }

  .tech-item {
    padding: 17px 25px;
    background: #111b30;
    border: 1px solid #263650;
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: #dbeafe;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .footer {
    padding: 28px 15px;
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 1px solid #1e293b;
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  @media(max-width: 650px) {
    .site-header { padding: 20px 5%; }
    .nav-links { gap: 12px; }
    .nav-links a { font-size: 12px; }
    .hero { padding-top: 80px; }
    .hero h1 { letter-spacing: -1.5px; }
  }
</style>

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="brand">DevSec<span>Pro</span></div>

  <nav class="nav-links">
    <a href="#">Home</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#technologies">Technologies</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">CLOUD • DEVOPS • AUTOMATION • SECURITY</div>

    <h1>
      Build. Deploy.<br>
      <span class="gradient-text">Secure. Scale.</span>
    </h1>

    <p>
      Welcome to DevSecPro — exploring modern cloud infrastructure,
      DevOps automation, containerization and secure application
      deployment.
    </p>

    <div class="actions">
      <a href="#technologies" class="btn btn-primary">
        Explore Technologies →
      </a>

      <a href="/health" class="btn btn-secondary">
        Check System Health
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="about">
    <h2>Engineering the Future</h2>
    <p>
      Building reliable, scalable and secure applications using
      modern cloud-native technologies and automation practices.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="technologies">
    <h2>Our Technology Stack</h2>
    <p>Tools and technologies powering modern infrastructure.</p>

    <div class="tech-grid">
      <div class="tech-item">AWS</div>
      <div class="tech-item">Docker-1.0</div>
      <div class="tech-item">Kubernetes</div>
      <div class="tech-item">Terraform</div>
      <div class="tech-item">Jenkins</div>
      <div class="tech-item">GitHub Actions</div>
      <div class="tech-item">Linux</div>
      <div class="tech-item">Ansible</div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="footer">
  © <%= Date.current.year %> DevSecPro. Built with Ruby on Rails (V-1.0).
</footer>
